          "docs": "Add an identifier to the triples (as a relationship with the predicate 'http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier'). It is then available in the Dublin Core and index automatically, but will not be added to metadata. IDs added this way are usually added by PHAIDRA (for Handles), while the IDs in metadata are added and controlled by the user."
